commit 0b745fff4381637d5686be786d91a67a6bf01202
Author: Van Tran <940988+vantt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Fri Jul 17 11:13:05 2026 +0700

    feat(fan-out-parallel-11): unified catchup CLI verb for merge-related drift (D6/D7/D11)
    
    Adds `fgos catchup <id>`: merges the resolved target (main for a root,
    the parent's fgw/<root> branch for a leaf) into a blocked item's own
    branch in an ephemeral worktree, verifies before commit, and on a
    clean pass moves blocked -> proposed via D18's edge. A real conflict
    or a failing verify aborts cleanly and leaves the item blocked for a
    human. One mechanism handles both root->main (D7) and leaf->parent
    (D11) drift, proven by the real-conflict spike.

